  <article class="about-copy">
    <p class="about-kicker">Our story · Boston, since 2022</p>
    <h1>I started with<br/>a home oven.</h1>
    <p>I started Brick Street Bagels in my South End apartment in late 2022, baking before and after my day job and delivering bagels by bike to neighbors.</p>
    <p>Nine months later, Andrew joined me and we moved into Bar Mezzana’s kitchen. We baked before dawn, loaded up the car, and served the park pop-ups that brought our community together.</p>
    <p>Those popups led to The Buttery and eventually a permanent home in South Boston. I’m still grateful to everyone who has shown up for us—and I’m excited to keep making bagels, coffee, and new ideas for both neighborhoods.</p>
    <p class="about-signoff">The bagel adventure continues.</p>
    <p class="founder">Jordan Renouf <span>Founder / Owner / Sneezes weird</span></p>
  </article>
